- Y. Bengio, R. Ducharme, P. Vincent and C. Jauvin (2003). "A neural probabilistic language model". *Journal of Machine Learning Research* 3, 1137–1155.
- T. Mikolov, I. Sutskever, K. Chen, G. Corrado and J. Dean (2013). "Distributed representations of words and phrases and their compositionality". *Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems* 26.
- O. Levy and Y. Goldberg (2014). "Neural word embedding as implicit matrix factorization". *Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems* 27.
- J. Pennington, R. Socher and C. D. Manning (2014). "GloVe: global vectors for word representation". *EMNLP*, 1532–1543.
- O. Levy, Y. Goldberg and I. Dagan (2015). "Improving distributional similarity with lessons learned from word embeddings". *Transactions of the Association for Computational Linguistics* 3, 211–225.
- C. Guo and F. Berkhahn (2016). "Entity embeddings of categorical variables". arXiv:1604.06737
